01:01:20.820 --> 01:01:27.910
<v Wes>They make a really distinctive-- [HUFFING] sound when they're really, really upset.
<v Wes>当它们非常、非常愤怒时，会发出一种非常明显的（喷气）声。

01:01:27.910 --> 01:01:32.910
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。
